---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site, luma } from '../config';
import { url } from '../lib';

const values = [
  { title: 'Everyone is a guest', body: 'Whether you have lived here for twenty years or landed this morning, there is a seat for you.' },
  { title: 'Food and wine done properly', body: 'Small, high-quality events built around cooking and pours we are genuinely excited about.' },
  { title: 'Connection on purpose', body: 'We think about who sits where and how the night flows, so conversation comes easily.' },
];
---

<Base title="About" description="The story behind The Common Thread, a Barcelona supper club built around food, wine and connection.">
  <section class="section section--dark">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>Finding belonging at the dinner table.</h1>
      <p class="lede">{site.description}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap story">
      <h2>The story</h2>
      <p>
        When Kevin Hawkins moved to Barcelona from Amsterdam, he did what came naturally: he started cooking for
        people. Dinners at his own table became a way to build a sense of home and community in a new city.
      </p>
      <p>
        Word spread. Friends brought friends, and friends of friends brought people they had met that week. What
        began as intimate gatherings has grown into a social circle of locals, expats, creatives, solo travellers
        and food lovers, with supper clubs, wine tastings and pop-up events across Barcelona.
      </p>
      <p>
        The idea has stayed the same: a carefully crafted night, great food and wine, and a table full of people
        who are glad they came.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">What we care about</p>
      <div class="grid">
        {values.map((v) => (
          <div class="card">
            <h3>{v.title}</h3>
            <p>{v.body}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn" href={luma.calendarUrl || url('events/')}>Join an event</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .story {
    max-width: 760px;
  }
</style>
